    "name": "Nine Nines",
    "steam_appid": 2880240,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilizing advanced procedural generation with the voronoi algorithm, each map is meticulously crafted, ensuring no two games are ever the same. Prepare your strategies and defend against relentless waves of enemies on ever-changing battlefields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally Generated Maps: Experience endless variety with maps that are uniquely generated each time you play. The voronoi algorithm ensures that the pathways and buildable areas are always fresh and challenging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880240/extras/be3d95a69480ae37391a6895b27eb7de.poster.avif?t=1729564030\" width=616 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880240/extras/be3d95a69480ae37391a6895b27eb7de.webm?t=1729564030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880240/extras/be3d95a69480ae37391a6895b27eb7de.mp4?t=1729564030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campaigns: Test your skills across three distinct campaigns:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Desert Hell: Navigate the scorching sands and defend your base against waves of heat-resistant foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Snow Blizzard: Brace yourself for the chilling onslaught in a frozen wasteland where icy enemies won't give you a moment's respite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Acid Waste: Survive the toxic terrain and fend off poisonous adversaries in a desolate, hazardous environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Map Mode: Take on an infinite number of maps \u2013 999,999,999 to be precise. Choose specific maps to match your preferences or to compete with friends on the same battlefield. Relive your favorite maps or challenge yourself with new ones every playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880240/extras/8c2c21653be960700931f186a61fea83.poster.avif?t=1729564030\" width=616 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880240/extras/8c2c21653be960700931f186a61fea83.webm?t=1729564030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880240/extras/8c2c21653be960700931f186a61fea83.mp4?t=1729564030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High Score System: Keep track of your progress and strive for greatness. The internal high score system records your kills and times, allowing you to revisit and replay maps directly from your score history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic Depth: With a variety of towers and upgrades at your disposal, devise intricate strategies to outsmart and outlast your enemies. Position your defenses wisely and adapt to the ever-shifting landscape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Community and Competition: Share your favorite maps with friends, compare high scores, and compete to see who can achieve the longest survival and highest kill count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for an exhilarating tower defense journey like never before. Defend your base, conquer the maps, and rise to the top in Nine Nines!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Nine Nines community today and embark on a tower defense adventure that will test your tactical prowess and adaptability!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilizing advanced procedural generation with the voronoi algorithm, each map is meticulously crafted, ensuring no two games are ever the same. Prepare your strategies and defend against relentless waves of enemies on ever-changing battlefields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally Generated Maps: Experience endless variety with maps that are uniquely generated each time you play. The voronoi algorithm ensures that the pathways and buildable areas are always fresh and challenging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880240/extras/be3d95a69480ae37391a6895b27eb7de.poster.avif?t=1729564030\" width=616 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880240/extras/be3d95a69480ae37391a6895b27eb7de.webm?t=1729564030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880240/extras/be3d95a69480ae37391a6895b27eb7de.mp4?t=1729564030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campaigns: Test your skills across three distinct campaigns:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Desert Hell: Navigate the scorching sands and defend your base against waves of heat-resistant foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Snow Blizzard: Brace yourself for the chilling onslaught in a frozen wasteland where icy enemies won't give you a moment's respite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Acid Waste: Survive the toxic terrain and fend off poisonous adversaries in a desolate, hazardous environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Map Mode: Take on an infinite number of maps \u2013 999,999,999 to be precise. Choose specific maps to match your preferences or to compete with friends on the same battlefield. Relive your favorite maps or challenge yourself with new ones every playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880240/extras/8c2c21653be960700931f186a61fea83.poster.avif?t=1729564030\" width=616 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880240/extras/8c2c21653be960700931f186a61fea83.webm?t=1729564030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880240/extras/8c2c21653be960700931f186a61fea83.mp4?t=1729564030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High Score System: Keep track of your progress and strive for greatness. The internal high score system records your kills and times, allowing you to revisit and replay maps directly from your score history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic Depth: With a variety of towers and upgrades at your disposal, devise intricate strategies to outsmart and outlast your enemies. Position your defenses wisely and adapt to the ever-shifting landscape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Community and Competition: Share your favorite maps with friends, compare high scores, and compete to see who can achieve the longest survival and highest kill count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for an exhilarating tower defense journey like never before. Defend your base, conquer the maps, and rise to the top in Nine Nines!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Nine Nines community today and embark on a tower defense adventure that will test your tactical prowess and adaptability!</p>",
    "short_description": "Dive into the chaotic world of Nine Nines, the ultimate tower defense experience where every playthrough is a unique challenge! Through 3 campaigns and endless procedurally generated maps, you can grind your way into defeating the strongest enemies!",
